## Product Overview

Documents Management Core is the initial 30-day delivery phase of the EMIS-X Documents Manager — a generic document management solution for General Practice in England, initially scoped to the EMIS Web install base. The product launches inbox-first — consolidating all inbound document management into a single, safe, efficient workflow — with a strategic intent to deliver functionality that makes third-party solutions (Docman, Anima) obsolete and replaces current EMIS Web document workflow capabilities.

**North Star:** Design a document management module which is *safe*, *fast and easy to use*, *automates administrative actions* and *isn't reliant on 3rd party vendors*.

**Delivery Channels:** Companion app + Browser (both required at launch)

**Regulatory Classification:** DCB0129 (Clinical Risk Management — Manufacturer). SaMD classification assessment required pre go-live; current intent is to remain below medical device classification threshold.

