## Personas

### Persona 1: Practice Admin / Document Processing Admin (Primary Operational User)
- Handles high volumes; triage, filing, coding
- May include dedicated coders in larger practices
- Low–medium tech-savviness; change risk for long-tenured staff
- Key need: low-friction UX at high volume

### Persona 2: Clinician (GP / Pharmacist)
- Primary goal: document content available as soon as possible
- Top pain points:
  1. Unclear what action is required / where to look
  2. Delays before documents visible
  3. Highlights/annotations not visible when viewing in EMIS

